Co-operative Mode
- Play CAMPAIGN maps and BATTLEMODE arenas with friends. The playable Archvile is replaced with a Slayer. At least one player should select a Slayer on the left podium slot. The host may restart the map and activate fast travel points to skip through parts of the map.

CO-OP ADDON - Hordamex
- Installs the Hordamex custom map that must be played with the Co-operative Mode mod.
- The zip file will be removed after it is installed and the map resources will stay in your DOOMEternal folder so it will not need to be reinstalled.

CO-OP ADDON - Mega Randomizer Slaughter Map
- This is an optional addon for Co-operative Mode, which means this mod and Co-operative Mode must be installed together.
- Slaughter Map for the BATTLEMODE arenas, Forsaken & Stronghold.\nDemon spawns, hazards, music, and powerups are endlessly randomized


Invasion Mode
- Play CAMPAIGN maps with Demon Players hunting the Slayer.
- The Slayer must complete all encounters. The Demons must kill the Slayer.


Slayer vs Slayer
- Engage in Slayer vs Slayer combat within BATTLEMODE & CAMPAIGN maps.
- Win 3 rounds to claim victory or participate in endless rounds.


Extra Playable Demons
- This is a modders resource.
- Adds the Arachnotron, Baron of Hell, Cacodemon, Doom Hunter, & Tyrant as playable characters to BATTLEMODE.
